 🚑 Link Cell Therapies , a South SF-based oncology cell therapy startup, raised $30m in additional Series A funding, bringing to round to $90m . Johnson &amp; Johnson led the A, joined by Samsara BioCapital, Sheatree Capital, BMS, Kyowa Kirin, Sherpa Healthcare Partners, Western Technology Investment and the MD Anderson Cancer Focus Fund. axios.link/4hTGtPO 

 • Modulate , a Somerville, Mass.-based audio AI startup, raised $25m led by Future Ventures . axios.link/4rAk8Kt 

 • Atomic , a Boston-based supply chain planning platform, raised $12.5m from Klass Capital and Madrona Venture Group , per Axios Pro . axios.link/3TcMs9f 

 • Rig Security , an Israeli identity protection startup, raised $12m in seed funding led by Ten Eleven Ventures and Brightmind Partners , per Axios Pro. axios.link/4htrHzr 

 • Rivet , an NYC-based dating site from former Tinder and Match Group executive Taru Kapoor, raised $10.5m in seed funding, backed by Peak XV Partners, Shine Capital and Blume Ventures. axios.link/4yodQ3l 

 • Blue Fire AI a Tokyo-based active management company, raised $9m with participation from Asset Management One Co. axios.link/4yZ0UAD 

 • HiringCafe , an SF-based job discovery platform, raised $6.8m in pre-seed funding. Spark Capital led, joined by Nonfiction Capital and Silicon Gardens. axios.link/3V5WwBv 

 • F2 , an agentic OS for institutional credit, raised $5m from Golub Capital . axios.link/4rD296c 

 ⚡️Overlord Labs , San Jose, Calif.-based semiconductor company building battery intelligence infrastructure, extended its seed by $4.4m. Band of Angels led, joined by Foothill Ventures, Unlock Pacific Ventures, NuFund Venture Group, Sand Hill Angels and Castle Fund. axios.link/4iPZrYN 

 • Granite , a Portuguese "agentic cloud" startup, raised €4m led by Bifrost Studios . axios.link/3TVIv95 

